# CODEOWNERS — default reviewers for pull requests (AUDIT-163).
#
# GitHub requests a review from the matching owner(s) automatically when a PR
# touches a path. The LAST matching pattern wins, so order matters: the
# catch-all is first, more specific paths below override it.
#
# Replace @xphox2 with the actual maintainer handle(s) / a team
# (e.g. @org/maintainers) as the project grows.

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
*                       @xphox2

# --- Security-sensitive surfaces: auth, crypto, secrets, middleware. ---
/internal/auth/         @xphox2
/internal/secrets/      @xphox2
/internal/api/middleware/ @xphox2
/internal/httputil/ssrf.go @xphox2

# --- Database schema / migrations (data-integrity blast radius). ---
/internal/database/     @xphox2

# --- Build / deploy / CI surface. ---
/Dockerfile             @xphox2
/Makefile               @xphox2
/entrypoint.sh          @xphox2
/deploy.sh              @xphox2
/.github/               @xphox2

# --- The public-release audit + handoff docs. ---
/docs/AUDIT.md          @xphox2
/docs/HANDOFF.md        @xphox2
